{"version":1,"content":"<p>Sensor Tower追蹤數據估算，《GTA6/俠盜獵車6》首日售出約2458萬份，帶來約23.6億美元收入，其中PlayStation平台約佔75%，Xbox約佔25%。Rockstar與Take-Two尚未確認這些首日數據，相關統計也未計入退款，因此目前只能視為第三方估算。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587196.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:03:58.641133+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:40:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:18.137144+00:00","content_hash":"f68683bf5a6a2887ede510d24ed2af9953a153a5762beab9866bc0cbb1be5707","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}